{"cast":"coach","group":"coach","bank":"coach.1ee196009d.bin","lines":[{"id":"coach.penultimate.short.01","moment":"coach.penultimate.short","text":"Short penultimate, so the plant became a stomp. Longer and lower next time.","off":0,"len":23672,"sec":4.469},{"id":"coach.penultimate.short.02","moment":"coach.penultimate.short","text":"Lengthen your penultimate. A longer, lower step lets the hips drop and load.","off":23672,"len":23485,"sec":4.575},{"id":"coach.penultimate.short.03","moment":"coach.penultimate.short","text":"Your second-to-last step was choppy. Stretch it out so you can gather.","off":47157,"len":21153,"sec":3.889},{"id":"coach.penultimate.short.04","moment":"coach.penultimate.short","text":"Think long penultimate, not late penultimate. That step is your gather.","off":68310,"len":21912,"sec":4.043},{"id":"coach.penultimate.long.01","moment":"coach.penultimate.long","text":"Your penultimate overreached, so the brake became a slide. Keep it long, but controlled.","off":90222,"len":26205,"sec":5.085},{"id":"coach.penultimate.long.02","moment":"coach.penultimate.long","text":"Brace your trunk on that long step, so you brake instead of sliding.","off":116427,"len":19593,"sec":3.494},{"id":"coach.penultimate.long.03","moment":"coach.penultimate.long","text":"Reel that step in a touch. Long and controlled beats long and sliding.","off":136020,"len":21077,"sec":4.002},{"id":"coach.penultimate.good.01","moment":"coach.penultimate.good","text":"Good penultimate. Long, low, and in control.","off":157097,"len":17034,"sec":2.852},{"id":"coach.penultimate.good.02","moment":"coach.penultimate.good","text":"That second-to-last step set up the whole jump.","off":174131,"len":15854,"sec":2.626},{"id":"coach.penultimate.good.03","moment":"coach.penultimate.good","text":"Long and low into the plant. That is your gather.","off":189985,"len":16548,"sec":2.73},{"id":"coach.penultimate.good.04","moment":"coach.penultimate.good","text":"Nice. You lowered your hips with control on that step.","off":206533,"len":16175,"sec":2.732},{"id":"coach.load.upright.01","moment":"coach.load.upright","text":"Pretty run, but you never loaded. Sink your hips into the gather.","off":222708,"len":19297,"sec":3.413},{"id":"coach.load.upright.02","moment":"coach.load.upright","text":"You stayed tall. Sit into the gather so your legs can load.","off":242005,"len":18398,"sec":3.202},{"id":"coach.load.upright.03","moment":"coach.load.upright","text":"Lower your hips a touch. No load, no spring.","off":260403,"len":16182,"sec":2.666},{"id":"coach.load.deep.01","moment":"coach.load.deep","text":"You sank too deep and lost your bounce. Try a quicker, shallower gather.","off":276585,"len":20960,"sec":3.943},{"id":"coach.load.deep.02","moment":"coach.load.deep","text":"Too much squat at that speed. Stay higher so the spring can fire.","off":297545,"len":19639,"sec":3.637},{"id":"coach.load.deep.03","moment":"coach.load.deep","text":"Shorter dip next time. Lingering low turns your spring into heat, not height.","off":317184,"len":23501,"sec":4.414},{"id":"coach.armswing.late.01","moment":"coach.armswing.late","text":"Your arms were late. Drive them down on the penultimate, then whip them up.","off":340685,"len":21387,"sec":3.993},{"id":"coach.armswing.late.02","moment":"coach.armswing.late","text":"Arms down as the second-to-last step lands, then up through the takeoff. That adds lift.","off":362072,"len":26436,"sec":5.199},{"id":"coach.armswing.late.03","moment":"coach.armswing.late","text":"Late swing, so the lift came after you left. Start the arms down sooner.","off":388508,"len":22413,"sec":4.253},{"id":"coach.armswing.none.01","moment":"coach.armswing.none","text":"No arm swing. Swing both arms, that's twenty to thirty-eight percent more jump.","off":410921,"len":24458,"sec":4.618},{"id":"coach.armswing.none.02","moment":"coach.armswing.none","text":"Your arms stayed quiet, and that's jump left on the floor. Swing both, hard.","off":435379,"len":23341,"sec":4.399},{"id":"coach.armswing.none.03","moment":"coach.armswing.none","text":"Swing both arms back, then whip them up. Free height, every single jump.","off":458720,"len":22205,"sec":4.259},{"id":"coach.armswing.good.01","moment":"coach.armswing.good","text":"Arms right on time. Down on the penultimate, up through takeoff.","off":480925,"len":20827,"sec":3.768},{"id":"coach.armswing.good.02","moment":"coach.armswing.good","text":"Great arm timing. That swing added real height.","off":501752,"len":17303,"sec":2.982},{"id":"coach.armswing.good.03","moment":"coach.armswing.good","text":"Down, then whip up. Your arms were working for you.","off":519055,"len":17003,"sec":2.845},{"id":"coach.armswing.good.04","moment":"coach.armswing.good","text":"Beautiful swing. Arms and feet were in sync.","off":536058,"len":16144,"sec":2.613},{"id":"coach.kneedrive.low.01","moment":"coach.kneedrive.low","text":"Your free knee stayed low. Drive it up for height and rhythm.","off":552202,"len":18360,"sec":3.3},{"id":"coach.kneedrive.low.02","moment":"coach.kneedrive.low","text":"Drive that free knee toward your chest. It lifts the whole body.","off":570562,"len":19543,"sec":3.536},{"id":"coach.kneedrive.low.03","moment":"coach.kneedrive.low","text":"Free leg, not a passenger. Drive that knee up for lift.","off":590105,"len":18147,"sec":3.25},{"id":"coach.kneedrive.good.01","moment":"coach.kneedrive.good","text":"Free knee drove up. That's height and rhythm.","off":608252,"len":14895,"sec":2.375},{"id":"coach.kneedrive.good.02","moment":"coach.kneedrive.good","text":"Nice knee drive. It pulled you right up.","off":623147,"len":13963,"sec":2.265},{"id":"coach.kneedrive.good.03","moment":"coach.kneedrive.good","text":"Good. That free leg did its job.","off":637110,"len":12737,"sec":1.801},{"id":"coach.lean.01","moment":"coach.lean","text":"Leaning at takeoff sends force out, not up. Stay tall over the plant.","off":649847,"len":21441,"sec":3.987},{"id":"coach.lean.02","moment":"coach.lean","text":"Force has direction. Chest proud over the plant, and every bit goes up.","off":671288,"len":21951,"sec":4.115},{"id":"coach.lean.03","moment":"coach.lean","text":"Get tall over the plant foot. Every degree of lean taxes your height.","off":693239,"len":20886,"sec":3.776},{"id":"coach.jump.height.01","moment":"coach.jump.height","text":"You got up\u2026","off":714125,"len":8190,"sec":0.81},{"id":"coach.jump.height.02","moment":"coach.jump.height","text":"That jump measured\u2026","off":722315,"len":9760,"sec":1.149},{"id":"coach.jump.height.03","moment":"coach.jump.height","text":"Off the floor\u2026","off":732075,"len":8533,"sec":0.937},{"id":"coach.jump.height.04","moment":"coach.jump.height","text":"Your jump reads\u2026","off":740608,"len":9730,"sec":1.183},{"id":"coach.jump.best.01","moment":"coach.jump.best","text":"That's a new personal best!","off":750338,"len":11486,"sec":1.576},{"id":"coach.jump.best.02","moment":"coach.jump.best","text":"New best. Your highest jump yet.","off":761824,"len":12985,"sec":1.91},{"id":"coach.jump.best.03","moment":"coach.jump.best","text":"Personal record. The work is showing.","off":774809,"len":13754,"sec":2.093},{"id":"coach.jump.best.04","moment":"coach.jump.best","text":"Highest you've ever gone. Remember that feeling.","off":788563,"len":15442,"sec":2.526},{"id":"coach.jump.down.01","moment":"coach.jump.down","text":"A little under your usual. Check that long, low penultimate.","off":804005,"len":19678,"sec":3.58},{"id":"coach.jump.down.02","moment":"coach.jump.down","text":"Down a little. Rest a moment; tired legs leak height.","off":823683,"len":17657,"sec":3.034},{"id":"coach.jump.down.03","moment":"coach.jump.down","text":"Not your highest, and that's fine. Check your arm timing next rep.","off":841340,"len":19928,"sec":3.679},{"id":"coach.slam.early.01","moment":"coach.slam.early","text":"A touch early. Wait for the top, where your hand is highest.","off":861268,"len":18666,"sec":3.221},{"id":"coach.slam.early.02","moment":"coach.slam.early","text":"You swung before the peak. Let the jump rise, then finish.","off":879934,"len":18532,"sec":3.242},{"id":"coach.slam.early.03","moment":"coach.slam.early","text":"Patience at the top. Finish early and you give away height.","off":898466,"len":18539,"sec":3.27},{"id":"coach.slam.late.01","moment":"coach.slam.late","text":"A beat late, you were already falling. Finish right at the top.","off":917005,"len":19010,"sec":3.339},{"id":"coach.slam.late.02","moment":"coach.slam.late","text":"Late finish, and the rim got away. Strike at the top.","off":936015,"len":17609,"sec":3.013},{"id":"coach.slam.late.03","moment":"coach.slam.late","text":"Finish at the peak. On the way down, you've lost reach.","off":953624,"len":16551,"sec":2.891},{"id":"coach.slam.good.01","moment":"coach.slam.good","text":"Right at the top. Perfect timing.","off":970175,"len":13597,"sec":2.026},{"id":"coach.slam.good.02","moment":"coach.slam.good","text":"Finished at the peak. That's the window.","off":983772,"len":13427,"sec":2.051},{"id":"coach.slam.good.03","moment":"coach.slam.good","text":"Great timing. You met the rim at your highest.","off":997199,"len":15623,"sec":2.537},{"id":"coach.slam.good.04","moment":"coach.slam.good","text":"Top of the jump, ball through. Clean.","off":1012822,"len":13561,"sec":2.091},{"id":"coach.offarm.01","moment":"coach.offarm","text":"Throw your off arm down as the finishing hand rises. It lifts your reach.","off":1026383,"len":21644,"sec":4.131},{"id":"coach.offarm.02","moment":"coach.offarm","text":"Use the off arm. Drive it down and your finishing hand climbs higher.","off":1048027,"len":21523,"sec":3.986},{"id":"coach.offarm.03","moment":"coach.offarm","text":"Play the off arm with intent. Down low sends your finishing hand higher.","off":1069550,"len":21556,"sec":3.968},{"id":"coach.landing.stiff.01","moment":"coach.landing.stiff","text":"Stiff landing. Sit into your hips to spare your knees.","off":1091106,"len":16648,"sec":2.76},{"id":"coach.landing.stiff.02","moment":"coach.landing.stiff","text":"That landing was rigid. Let ankles, knees and hips share the load.","off":1107754,"len":21173,"sec":3.983},{"id":"coach.landing.stiff.03","moment":"coach.landing.stiff","text":"Bend your ankles when you land. They soak up the shock.","off":1128927,"len":16701,"sec":2.817},{"id":"coach.landing.valgus.01","moment":"coach.landing.valgus","text":"Knees caved in. Track them over your midfoot to protect the joint.","off":1145628,"len":20081,"sec":3.601},{"id":"coach.landing.valgus.02","moment":"coach.landing.valgus","text":"Land with knees over the middle of your feet. Knees stay safe.","off":1165709,"len":19219,"sec":3.501},{"id":"coach.landing.valgus.03","moment":"coach.landing.valgus","text":"Your knees drifted in. Keep them over the midfoot, so they last.","off":1184928,"len":19191,"sec":3.412},{"id":"coach.landing.good.01","moment":"coach.landing.good","text":"Good landing. Soft, organized, ready.","off":1204119,"len":15777,"sec":2.519},{"id":"coach.landing.good.02","moment":"coach.landing.good","text":"Nice landing. You could go again right away.","off":1219896,"len":15000,"sec":2.448},{"id":"coach.landing.good.03","moment":"coach.landing.good","text":"Landed on purpose. That's how you last.","off":1234896,"len":14459,"sec":2.261},{"id":"coach.shot.early.01","moment":"coach.shot.early","text":"Early release. Let your legs lift the ball, and release near the top.","off":1249355,"len":20538,"sec":3.657},{"id":"coach.shot.early.02","moment":"coach.shot.early","text":"Ride the jump a beat longer. The top gives you the cleanest release.","off":1269893,"len":19753,"sec":3.522},{"id":"coach.shot.early.03","moment":"coach.shot.early","text":"You shot on the way up. Let the jump lift the ball first.","off":1289646,"len":18648,"sec":3.242},{"id":"coach.shot.late.01","moment":"coach.shot.late","text":"Late release. Let go at the top while your legs still help.","off":1308294,"len":17577,"sec":3.083},{"id":"coach.shot.late.02","moment":"coach.shot.late","text":"Shooting on the way down costs you power. Release at the top.","off":1325871,"len":19655,"sec":3.378},{"id":"coach.shot.late.03","moment":"coach.shot.late","text":"You were already coming down. Let it go at the peak.","off":1345526,"len":16176,"sec":2.682},{"id":"coach.shot.good.01","moment":"coach.shot.good","text":"Released near the top. Right on time.","off":1361702,"len":13931,"sec":2.158},{"id":"coach.shot.good.02","moment":"coach.shot.good","text":"Good release point. The jump did the lifting.","off":1375633,"len":15584,"sec":2.528},{"id":"coach.shot.good.03","moment":"coach.shot.good","text":"On time. Legs up, ball out at the peak.","off":1391217,"len":14846,"sec":2.327},{"id":"coach.shot.good.04","moment":"coach.shot.good","text":"That's the timing. Top of the jump, soft release.","off":1406063,"len":17048,"sec":2.865},{"id":"coach.shot.setpoint.01","moment":"coach.shot.setpoint","text":"Low set point, easy to block. Set it at your forehead.","off":1423111,"len":17820,"sec":3.122},{"id":"coach.shot.setpoint.02","moment":"coach.shot.setpoint","text":"Raise your set point to the forehead. Higher is harder to block.","off":1440931,"len":19226,"sec":3.456},{"id":"coach.shot.setpoint.03","moment":"coach.shot.setpoint","text":"Ball sat at your chin. Set it higher, out of reach.","off":1460157,"len":16353,"sec":2.768},{"id":"coach.shot.elbow.01","moment":"coach.shot.elbow","text":"Your elbow flared out, so the ball went sideways. Tuck it under.","off":1476510,"len":19840,"sec":3.571},{"id":"coach.shot.elbow.02","moment":"coach.shot.elbow","text":"Elbow under the ball. It keeps the shot on a straight line.","off":1496350,"len":18452,"sec":3.243},{"id":"coach.shot.elbow.03","moment":"coach.shot.elbow","text":"Flared elbow. Line it up under the ball so it flies straight.","off":1514802,"len":19887,"sec":3.551},{"id":"coach.shot.hitch.01","moment":"coach.shot.hitch","text":"Hitch at the set point. One motion keeps your legs in it.","off":1534689,"len":17218,"sec":2.993},{"id":"coach.shot.hitch.02","moment":"coach.shot.hitch","text":"Two motions there. Flow through the set point so the power carries.","off":1551907,"len":19684,"sec":3.499},{"id":"coach.shot.hitch.03","moment":"coach.shot.hitch","text":"Don't park the ball up top. One smooth motion, legs to fingertips.","off":1571591,"len":22550,"sec":4.189},{"id":"coach.shot.follow.01","moment":"coach.shot.follow","text":"Hold that follow-through till the ball lands. It keeps the release clean.","off":1594141,"len":20181,"sec":3.78},{"id":"coach.shot.follow.02","moment":"coach.shot.follow","text":"Early drop on the follow-through. Hold it, let the wrist finish.","off":1614322,"len":19102,"sec":3.371},{"id":"coach.shot.follow.03","moment":"coach.shot.follow","text":"Hand came down early. Leave it up till the ball lands.","off":1633424,"len":17876,"sec":3.089},{"id":"coach.strike.guard.01","moment":"coach.strike.guard","text":"Hands back to your guard after every strike. That's your protection.","off":1651300,"len":20117,"sec":3.596},{"id":"coach.strike.guard.02","moment":"coach.strike.guard","text":"Low hands after the strike leave you open. Bring them right back.","off":1671417,"len":19806,"sec":3.641},{"id":"coach.strike.guard.03","moment":"coach.strike.guard","text":"Strike, then home. Hands up protects you for the next exchange.","off":1691223,"len":20241,"sec":3.596},{"id":"coach.strike.hips.01","moment":"coach.strike.hips","text":"All arm on that one. Turn your hips into it for power.","off":1711464,"len":17666,"sec":3.007},{"id":"coach.strike.hips.02","moment":"coach.strike.hips","text":"Power starts at the floor. Rotate your hips through the strike.","off":1729130,"len":18791,"sec":3.284},{"id":"coach.strike.hips.03","moment":"coach.strike.hips","text":"Turn the hips first, and the arm just delivers it.","off":1747921,"len":16877,"sec":2.742},{"id":"coach.strike.chin.01","moment":"coach.strike.chin","text":"Chin down, eyes up. A raised chin is exposed.","off":1764798,"len":17907,"sec":3.115},{"id":"coach.strike.chin.02","moment":"coach.strike.chin","text":"Your chin lifted. Tuck it so you stay protected.","off":1782705,"len":17151,"sec":2.884},{"id":"coach.strike.chin.03","moment":"coach.strike.chin","text":"Tuck that chin, eyes still up. Safer and sharper.","off":1799856,"len":17766,"sec":3.084},{"id":"coach.strike.good.01","moment":"coach.strike.good","text":"Clean strike. Hips in, hands home.","off":1817622,"len":13633,"sec":2.047},{"id":"coach.strike.good.02","moment":"coach.strike.good","text":"That's it. Power from the hips, guard right back.","off":1831255,"len":15576,"sec":2.554},{"id":"coach.strike.good.03","moment":"coach.strike.good","text":"Sharp. Everything turned together on that one.","off":1846831,"len":15100,"sec":2.359},{"id":"coach.board.absorb.01","moment":"coach.board.absorb","text":"Straight legs on that landing. Bend your knees to soak it up.","off":1861931,"len":18808,"sec":3.276},{"id":"coach.board.absorb.02","moment":"coach.board.absorb","text":"Let your knees be the suspension. Soft legs keep you riding.","off":1880739,"len":19309,"sec":3.431},{"id":"coach.board.absorb.03","moment":"coach.board.absorb","text":"You landed stiff. Knees absorb it so you ride away clean.","off":1900048,"len":18927,"sec":3.498},{"id":"coach.board.low.01","moment":"coach.board.low","text":"You stayed tall through that turn. Get low for balance.","off":1918975,"len":17901,"sec":3.152},{"id":"coach.board.low.02","moment":"coach.board.low","text":"Sink lower, weight over the board. That's where your balance lives.","off":1936876,"len":19296,"sec":3.516},{"id":"coach.board.low.03","moment":"coach.board.low","text":"Too upright in the turn. A lower stance grips the edge.","off":1956172,"len":18456,"sec":3.215},{"id":"coach.board.good.01","moment":"coach.board.good","text":"Low and balanced. Nice riding.","off":1974628,"len":13155,"sec":1.95},{"id":"coach.board.good.02","moment":"coach.board.good","text":"Great stance through that turn.","off":1987783,"len":11535,"sec":1.569},{"id":"coach.board.good.03","moment":"coach.board.good","text":"Smooth. Knees soft, weight centered.","off":1999318,"len":13927,"sec":2.104},{"id":"coach.encourage.01","moment":"coach.encourage","text":"Shake it off. Next one's yours.","off":2013245,"len":12935,"sec":1.864},{"id":"coach.encourage.02","moment":"coach.encourage","text":"That's how you learn. Go again.","off":2026180,"len":11743,"sec":1.617},{"id":"coach.encourage.03","moment":"coach.encourage","text":"No worries. Reset and breathe.","off":2037923,"len":12761,"sec":1.8},{"id":"coach.encourage.04","moment":"coach.encourage","text":"Good effort. Every rep teaches you something.","off":2050684,"len":15102,"sec":2.392},{"id":"coach.encourage.05","moment":"coach.encourage","text":"Stay with it. You're closer than you think.","off":2065786,"len":13728,"sec":2.073},{"id":"coach.praise.01","moment":"coach.praise","text":"That's the one. Everything lined up.","off":2079514,"len":13743,"sec":2.084},{"id":"coach.praise.02","moment":"coach.praise","text":"Beautiful rep, start to finish.","off":2093257,"len":12057,"sec":1.722},{"id":"coach.praise.03","moment":"coach.praise","text":"Clean from the approach to the landing.","off":2105314,"len":12635,"sec":1.811},{"id":"coach.praise.04","moment":"coach.praise","text":"Yes! That's the rep we're chasing.","off":2117949,"len":12510,"sec":1.763},{"id":"coach.praise.05","moment":"coach.praise","text":"Textbook. Remember exactly how that felt.","off":2130459,"len":15373,"sec":2.475},{"id":"coach.drill.intro.01","moment":"coach.drill.intro","text":"Drill time. Follow the targets and move with the rhythm.","off":2145832,"len":17552,"sec":2.98},{"id":"coach.drill.intro.02","moment":"coach.drill.intro","text":"Here comes a drill. Hit each target as it lights up.","off":2163384,"len":17455,"sec":2.865},{"id":"coach.drill.intro.03","moment":"coach.drill.intro","text":"Let's warm up. Watch the targets and match them.","off":2180839,"len":16481,"sec":2.718},{"id":"coach.drill.go.01","moment":"coach.drill.go","text":"Go.","off":2197320,"len":6917,"sec":0.605},{"id":"coach.drill.go.02","moment":"coach.drill.go","text":"Here we go.","off":2204237,"len":8309,"sec":0.874},{"id":"coach.drill.go.03","moment":"coach.drill.go","text":"Start now.","off":2212546,"len":8309,"sec":0.832},{"id":"coach.drill.go.04","moment":"coach.drill.go","text":"And go!","off":2220855,"len":7687,"sec":0.734},{"id":"coach.drill.nice.01","moment":"coach.drill.nice","text":"Nice.","off":2228542,"len":7680,"sec":0.677},{"id":"coach.drill.nice.02","moment":"coach.drill.nice","text":"Good rhythm.","off":2236222,"len":8360,"sec":0.828},{"id":"coach.drill.nice.03","moment":"coach.drill.nice","text":"That's it.","off":2244582,"len":7875,"sec":0.768},{"id":"coach.drill.nice.04","moment":"coach.drill.nice","text":"Clean.","off":2252457,"len":7168,"sec":0.663},{"id":"coach.drill.nice.05","moment":"coach.drill.nice","text":"Right on beat.","off":2259625,"len":8890,"sec":1.006},{"id":"coach.drill.faster.01","moment":"coach.drill.faster","text":"Pick it up.","off":2268515,"len":7755,"sec":0.779},{"id":"coach.drill.faster.02","moment":"coach.drill.faster","text":"Quicker now.","off":2276270,"len":7788,"sec":0.784},{"id":"coach.drill.faster.03","moment":"coach.drill.faster","text":"Faster feet.","off":2284058,"len":8799,"sec":0.979},{"id":"coach.drill.slower.01","moment":"coach.drill.slower","text":"Slow it down.","off":2292857,"len":8748,"sec":0.957},{"id":"coach.drill.slower.02","moment":"coach.drill.slower","text":"Easy, control it.","off":2301605,"len":10118,"sec":1.297},{"id":"coach.drill.slower.03","moment":"coach.drill.slower","text":"Smooth, not rushed.","off":2311723,"len":10118,"sec":1.163},{"id":"coach.drill.hold.01","moment":"coach.drill.hold","text":"Hold it there.","off":2321841,"len":8418,"sec":0.907},{"id":"coach.drill.hold.02","moment":"coach.drill.hold","text":"